{
  "id": "c1-e33-fairness-at-work",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Fairness at work",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what would make a workplace ideal for you?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think everyone gets an equal chance to succeed?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, have you ever felt that a situation was unfair?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is it to work in a diverse team?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e33-a1",
            "c1-e33-a2",
            "c1-e33-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people in workplaces. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be thinking, and what barriers some people might face.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10900
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations do you think is the fairest?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e33-b1",
            "c1-e33-b2",
            "c1-e33-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people dealing with problems at work. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be upset about, and how they could resolve their differences.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how should unfair situations at work be dealt with?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some measures to make workplaces fairer, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9900
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e33-fairness-at-work",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these measures help to create a fairer workplace?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e33-fairness-at-work",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about fairness and equality at work.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent have workplaces become fairer over the last few decades?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should companies be required by law to employ a certain proportion of people from different groups?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think pay should be made public?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How can employers make sure that people are chosen for their ability alone?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is it fair that some people have better opportunities because of the family they are born into?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, what role do trade unions have in modern working life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e33-fairness-at-work/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
